-gdyfxU iluFjz rid-61 pf-image-1"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-brPMkR cnEYUf rid-63 pf-heading-1-h3">Tony R.</h3><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-64 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-65 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-66 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-67 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-68 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><p class="sc-iMWBWc laPXAE rid-71 pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Great product.. even greater customer serviceVery good customer service: I had a problem with the original order… the Omni would not stay securely in my phone. The customer service dept was very helpful and understanding. They sent me a new one (very quickly,too) and it worked perfectly</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-dfavko TcUqD rid-60"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND rid-59 pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa rid-58"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/tps-omni_photos-1-1641410722890.jpg?v=1641410754" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/tps-omni_photos-1-1641410722890.jpg?v=1641410754 1536w" width="4032" height="3024" alt="TPSO Customer Review" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-gdyfxU iluFjz rid-47 pf-image-1"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-brPMkR cnEYUf rid-49 pf-heading-1-h3">Rosendo G.</h3><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-50 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-51 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-52 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-hwdACo sXHGY rid-53 pf-icon-1 pfa pfa-star" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="s